<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A domain extension of PERKOnto for the professional knowledge of a gravitational-wave / relativity physicist as extractable from personal email communications. It reuses the PERKOnto backbone and specialises the scientific layer into gravitational-physics concepts (AstrophysicalSource/ObservationalData/AnalysisMethod/PhysicalParameter/ResearchProblem) plus supporting concepts (Detector, WaveformModel, AnalysisPipeline)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "PERKOnto-Grav: Gravitational Physics extension of PERKOnto"@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/grav> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0" .
